{"id":"vod_sn_35640","vodId":"35640","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"狼与香辛料","name_cn":"狼与香辛料","date":"2008-01-01","year":"2008","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/7608b88bb89347f24fc85eb9482c45e4.jpg"},"summary":"在世界各地旅行并收购贩卖物品的旅行商人克拉福•劳伦斯在经过正在庆祝收获节的帕斯罗村后离开，却在自己堆满麦束的货车上发现了正在睡觉的少女。少女有狼的耳朵和尾巴，更有美丽的脸庞，她自报家门称自己是掌管丰收的狼神“赫萝”。　　虽然对这样的介绍半信半疑，但在赫萝的花言巧语之下，劳伦斯答应带赫萝回到遥远的北方故乡，就这样二人展开了旅行商人的旅程，并在行商途中遇到了各式各样的事件。　　赫萝的出现，改变了劳伦斯原本孤独的经商生活。虽然常常被赫萝狡猾的言论捉弄，但他与赫萝的羁绊也因此越来越深","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:36:27","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/bXkpFMGMC61/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/QRqxXDGHud1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/LKFPVdHnmt1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/urxdTNLQHX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/VRN6n91U3T1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qS8jhwF8iq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/nEKed8XzX61/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/BPxu8SmcVY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/jPVrL22bTM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/i66vRigrN91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/YWWvq1eayr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/BK1srXcPPF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/06wY1FhP2U1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:32.353Z"}